  "details": "Since the latest update, as of writing this on March 11th, Quest Beta takes far longer to load no matter what map I have as my home and what avatar I'm using, then loads into a totally black screen, leaving me unable to even see my menu. You ever worn your headset while it's off? It looks kinda like that, but you can tell that it's on as it's not 100% darkness and has a 5% of screen light.\n\nDue to this error making it so I cannot see my menu, let alone tell if I opened it, the amount of information I can provide is greatly reduced.\n\nFeel free to message me, here or in the official Discord under the same user, if you'd like me to try and provide a video of the issue.",
